    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Fintan Cahill Auctioneers are delighted to bring this impressive five-bedroom detached property at Beagh, Killinkere, Virginia to the market.\n\nSet on almost 2 acres, the property enjoys lovely views across the surrounding countryside and offers spacious, well-proportioned accommodation over two floors.\n\nThe ground floor offers a spacious and practical layout, with an entrance hall, a comfortable sitting room with open fireplace and a well-proportioned kitchen with stove, complemented by a separate utility room. Three of the five bedrooms are also located on this level, including one en-suite, along with the main bathroom.\n\nOne of the standout features of the property is the striking feature window positioned on the return of the staircase. Flooding the stairwell with natural light, it creates an impressive focal point and adds real character to the interior.\n\nUpstairs, there are two further generously sized bedrooms along with an additional bathroom. The spacious layout provides excellent flexibility for family living, guest accommodation or home office use.\n\nOutside, the property is surrounded by extensive grounds extending to almost 2 acres, while a detached garage provides valuable additional storage and parking.\n\nLocated in the pleasant rural setting of Killinkere, the property is within easy reach of both Virginia and Bailieborough, with a good range of shops, schools, services and amenities available in both towns.\n\nThe property also benefits from a BER B rating, adding to the overall comfort and energy efficiency of this substantial family home.\n\nFeatures:\n\nPanoramic countryside views \nFive spacious bedrooms\nGround-floor en-suite bedroom \nStunning feature window on the staircase return \nSitting room with open fireplace \nDetached garage\n\n"
